Test tools run locally, not dependencies, not distributed
---------------------------------------------------------

- extract-msg 0.56.1 (GPL-3.0), Python, used by qa/indep.py as an
  independent reader for comparison. It is run as a separate program from a
  local virtual environment; no code from it is included here.
- Sample .msg files used by qa/ are read by path from a local folder and are
  not part of this repository. Committed test fixtures are synthetic
  (built by test/helpers/build-msg.js) or are the published examples from
  [MS-OXRTFCP].

